#
# Copy this file to .env.local (untracked, see .gitignore) and uncomment
# the line below only if you need to override where this app looks for
# its backend (HYDRA-UMC-SERVER - github.com/JuanenRac/HYDRA-UMC-SERVER).
#
# You do NOT need this file for normal local development: `npm run dev`
# uses vite.config.ts's own dev proxy (relative paths -> localhost:3000),
# and a normal production deployment (frontend + backend on the same
# machine, e.g. the CM5) defaults to this same page's own hostname on
# port 3000 automatically - see src/lib/apiBase.ts.
#
# Set this only when the built frontend is hosted somewhere OTHER than
# the machine running HYDRA-UMC-SERVER (e.g. STUDIO's static files served
# from the cloud/another host, while HYDRA-UMC-SERVER stays on the CM5
# next to the robots).
# =============================================================================

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.50:3000
